## private_function_qualified (exit 1)
error[Z0103]: no public function `_twice` in `functions/clean.zeff`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | clean::_twice(2)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a function of the module
  |
  = help: a name starting with `_` is private to its file; a public function of the module has a page at `zeff help clean::name`

## third_party_package (exit 1)
error[Z0304]: `use stats` is not available in this release
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:1
  |
1 | use stats
  | ^^^^^^^^^ arrives with Zeff 1.11
  |
  = help: third-party packages arrive after 1.0; the project's own modules are brought in as `use functions::stats`

